    - target: {fileID: 5201088298951510640, guid: 6cfa9ac0518addd42bc8f5fbafddb72c,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '       MAP MAKING TECHNIQUE

        The current map you''re standing
        in was where the project started off. Initially I really struggled with where
        to start off! Every wall I placed wouldn''t align properly and it seemed
        like I would need way to many walls, but I came accross a cool trick for
        making levels pretty easily'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5201088298951510640, guid: 6cfa9ac0518addd42bc8f5fbafddb72c,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_VerticalAlignment
