    - target: {fileID: 5201088298951510640, guid: 6cfa9ac0518addd42bc8f5fbafddb72c,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\t\t<b>TOOL PARTS</b>\nEvery stage will have a set of parts that will
        need to be <b>picked up</b>. Collecting all <b>three parts</b> will unlock
        the exit door and allow the player to craft a tool after stage completion.
        Each part will explain a portion of how the tool was made."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
